        "id": "5d6cc979-3933-4d50-b095-41d82e36b84e",
        "meta_summary": "This document (DB) applies generally to the CTE, specifically addressing basic requirements for 'Fire Safety'. It excludes industrial buildings, establishments, and zones covered by specific industrial fire safety regulations. It also clarifies that the CTE does not cover fire initiation risks related to installations or storage regulated by specific legislation. The scope includes building works, fixed installations, equipment, and urban elements assigned to the building as per LOE Article 2.3.",
